      "text": "Two of City & Suburban's Google reviews describe exactly that. JC (Jul 2026) wrote: \"Two other companies would not even quote the job due to the roof location of the compressor. C&S H&C came and provided a quote on very short notice.\" Christopher A. (Jun 2025) wrote: \"They get full marks for hauling the equipment up five flights of stairs to the roof!\" Public ratings: 4.98 across 204 Google reviews, 4.9 from 251 reviews on Yelp, and a BBB A+ rating. The work carries a satisfaction guarantee."
